---@field burst? number The maximum capacity a single query can consume, measured as a percentage of seconds of full server usage (0-6000). Unlimited when not set.
---@field concurrency? number The percentage of available worker processes this policy can use (0-100). Unlimited when not set.
---@field warning_threshold? number A percentage of capacity, burst, or concurrency thresholds to emit warnings for enforced budgets (0-100).
---@field rules? planetscale.UpdateTrafficBudgetRequestRulesList Array of traffic rules to apply to the budget

---The mode of the traffic budget
---@alias planetscale.UpdateTrafficBudgetRequestMode "enforce"|"warn"|"off"

---Array of traffic rules to apply to the budget
---@alias planetscale.UpdateTrafficBudgetRequestRulesList string[]

